<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AuraWeather Pro | Historical & Forecast</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            --accent: #00f2fe;
            --bg: #0f172a;
